anCourses/6"]},{"type":"content","from":"MASE30013","to":"MASE50023","basis":"本方案两门课程的题名均含“半导体”，可据此对照这一主题。","rows":["/courseModules/10/planCourses/2","/courseModules/12/planCourses/0"]},{"type":"content","from":"MASE50023","to":"MASE50058","basis":"本方案两门课程的题名均含“半导体”，可据此对照这一主题。","rows":["/courseModules/12/planCourses/0","/courseModules/12/planCourses/6"]}],"guide":["建议先学　《智能材料综合实验Ⅰ》（MASE40003） → 《智能材料综合实验Ⅱ》（MASE40004） → 《智能材料综合实验Ⅲ》（MASE40005）。题名列出连续册次或级别。可沿用前一阶段的实验记录格式，对照后来新增的测量方法和误差来源。方案分别列在第4、5、6学期。","可以对照着读　《材料物理》（MASE30012）与《半导体与磁性材料物理》（MASE50058）。两门课的题名都涉及材料物理。对同一种材料，比较结构特征与可测量的物理性质怎样对应。","查模块选课　《智能材料前沿》（MASE40002）、《材料科学导论》（MASE20002）列在“专业核心教育课程”中。模块说明写明“要求修读34学分（部分课程学分可用荣誉课程学分替换）”。原表见 /courseModules/7。"],"sourceUrl":"https://fdjwgl.fudan.edu.cn/manager/bizType/2/major-program-search/info/96735?skipAuth=1","wordUrl":"https://github.com/pythonbug225/fudan-course-atlas/blob/research/schoolwide-cohorts-2023-2025/research/contributions/%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E8%83%BD%E6%BA%90%E5%88%9B%E6%96%B0%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/cohorts-2023-2025/2025/originals/plan-96735.docx","originalUrl":"https://github.com/pythonbug225/fudan-course-atlas/blob/research/schoolwide-cohorts-2023-2025/research/contributions/%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E8%83%BD%E6%BA%90%E5%88%9B%E6%96%B0%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/cohorts-2023-2025/2025/originals/plan-96735.docx","graphUrl":"https://github.com/pythonbug225/fudan-course-atlas/blob/research/schoolwide-cohorts-2023-2025/research/contributions/%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E8%83%BD%E6%BA%90%E5%88%9B%E6%96%B0%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/cohorts-2023-2025/2025/plans/96735.md","syllabusReferences":[]}